OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of historic cliff lift up
OL,4,Afor debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of a seaside town's historic
OL,7,Fcliff lift is up for debate, a month
OL,8,Fafter it was closed on safety grounds.
OL,10,FThe Victorian-era Scarborough Spa Cliff
OL,11,FLift was shut on 21 August after an
OL,12,Fengineering assessment identified
OL,13,Fissues with its infrastructure and
OL,14,Fcritical components.
OL,16,FMembers of Scarborough Town Council are
OL,17,Fset to discuss the closure and the
OL,18,Fprospects for reopening the lift at a
OL,19,Ffull council meeting later.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
