OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of historic cliff lift up
OL,4,Afor debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motion due to be put before
OL,7,Fcouncillors calls for formal
OL,8,Frepresentations to be made to North
OL,9,FYorkshire Council seeking clarification
OL,10,Fabout the reasons for the closure, any
OL,11,Fdefects requiring repair and likely
OL,12,Ftimescales for the attraction's return
OL,13,Fto service.
